  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-hf7iij90ffs00\">获取各平台素材属性列表</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1787532049997899%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1748264006369288%2C%22id%22%3A%223cAwQ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4kj7x1w5eec000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-4kj7x1w5eec000\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4xprfbkdvm0000\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/material_attributes/list/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1872669073010691\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-tbpjw4jtzuo00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-tbpjw4jtzuo00\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1bwiqmbbbbsw00\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-5dw9j4xedls000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-5dw9j4xedls000\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-179ofymrhr1c00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-179ofymrhr1c00\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">各平台账户id，需同时选择account_type类型\n需传入「获取已授权账户」接口返回的advertiser_id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户类型，允许值： 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2wgitojo8qe000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1a2nz3qx3bq800\"><code>BP</code> 巨量引擎工作台（纵横）</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-58w7w80sg5s000\"><code>AGENT</code> 巨量方舟</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2in1boeccva000\"><code>AD</code> 巨量</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-396i33ck3fg000\"><code>QIANCHUAN</code> 巨量千川</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-21c1f1g4euf400\"><code>LOCAL</code> 本地推</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">过滤条件</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">按素材ID过滤，范围为1-1000</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_properties</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">素材标签过滤项，如果不传，则默认返回投放账户ID下所有素材。\n允许值： 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-4c07y5z5fug000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3swkgk8xzwm000\"><code>AD_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> AD优质</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4wacdfyiweq000\"><code>AD_LOW_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> AD低质</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3sfp9r0l45k000\"><code>AIGC</code> AIGC</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2907ks11xmqs00\"><code>CARRY_MATERIAL</code> 素材存在打压风险</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1im2a1gio1og00\"><code>ECP_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 千川优质</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-eth0vj0jj3k00\"><code>ECP_LOW_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 千川低质</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4faijb5i0s6000\"><code>FIRST_PUBLISH_MATERIAL</code> 首发素材</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1mxfl82yj5y800\"><code>INEFFICIENT_MATERIAL</code> 低效</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5hjeynkotzo000\"><code>LOCAL_HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 本地推优质</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-231788js7sg000\"><code>LOCAL_LOW_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 本地推低质</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1p83ectzcvz400\"><code>SIMILAR_MATERIAL</code> 同质化</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1jtis51nyyv400\"><code>SIMILAR_QUEUE_MATERIAL</code> 同质化排队</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">起始日期，表示按照素材上传到账户下的时间过滤，格式为yyyy-mm-dd HH:MM:SS，最早允许传入时间：2022-01-01 00:00:00\n（时间是账号和素材绑定的时间，删除重绑时间会更新）</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">结束日期，表示过滤出一段时间内上传的素材，格式为yyyy-mm-dd HH:MM:SS，如果传入起始日期，未传此参数，则默认为当前时间</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">attributes_modify_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">「存在搬运风险」属性最后一次更新时间，格式为yyyy-mm-dd ，筛选传入代表筛选出当天「存在搬运风险」发生过变化的素材信息</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">return_lowquality_suggestions</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页面数据量，默认值: 100，page*page_size 最大1000</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页码，默认值: 1，page*page_size 最大1000</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-2kh1kf09js2000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-2kh1kf09js2000\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ffile%2Fmaterial_attributes%2Flist%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C